      title: "Vizit and Salsify Partner to Deliver AI-Powered Conversion Optimizer Application, Elevating Ecommerce Sales to New Heights",
      slug: "vizit-salsify-partner-ai-powered-conversion-optimizer-application",
      category: "Vizit News",
      author: "Vizit Team",
